      "keyFrameIntent": "旧版训练场/旧剧本关键帧，不能作为当前 Canon Map 模拟战视频资产：关键帧：模拟战动作完成或战术关系最清楚的一瞬，Sylvain 吸引对手，Ingrid 切入",
      "keyFramePrompt": "关键帧：模拟战动作完成或战术关系最清楚的一瞬，Sylvain 吸引对手，Ingrid 切入\nScene: 训练场. Characters: use selected assets and preserve identity. Camera: 横向运动. Generate a cinematic live-action storyboard key frame distinct from the start frame, showing the peak action or emotional beat. Keep academy students youthful and identity-locked. Avoid UI, text, watermark, modern objects, face swaps, old faces, and wrong costumes.",
      "sourcePackage": "episodes/EP02/video_generation_prompts_p1_act01_2026-07-13.md",
