      "generationPrompt": "Claude 的箭钉在 Ashe 高点前，迫使 Ashe 离开观察位。 Youthful academy students, controlled nonlethal exercise, no UI.\n\nCinematic continuity: Block=Mock Battle Expanded Action. Transition in: continues Scene09 tactical action geography. Transition out: cuts to the next tactical action beat. Screen/camera rule: Blue Lions pressure expands from southeast/central lane; Golden Deer side pressure and Black Eagles adjustments remain geographically readable. Audio bridge: horn, training weapon clacks, bowstring, magic pressure, controlled breaths. Generate with 2s editorial handle where possible; begin and end with usable motion, not a frozen poster. Maintain direction, eyelines, and spatial geography from adjacent shots.\n\nYouth/beauty guard: Keep academy students youthful, attractive, clean-skinned and official-game-inspired. Show tactical pressure through blocking, posture, sound and editing rather than aging faces.\n\nCamera: A Golden Deer arrow strikes the wooden rail just ahead of Ashe observation position, forcing Ashe to duck away and lose the clean sightline. The shot keeps impact nonlethal and shows Claude controlling space rather than trying to injure Ashe.\n\nScene09 production gate: do not generate final video from the blocked source image if it is SVG or legacy training-yard raster. Use production_image_path after a real cinematic raster keyframe is generated and QA-approved.\nCharacter continuity gate: every named character must match the listed selected.png reference assets for face, hair, age, costume silhouette, and color accents.",
