      "keyFramePrompt": "关键帧：Felix breaks out of the Blue Lions formation toward the northeast trigger approach of the Garreg Mach mock battle map. He is a youthful dark-blue-haired duelist in black vest and white sleeves, moving too far ahead with a wooden training sword. Ahead are stone steps, low walls, red-black Black Eagles markers, distant Golden Deer depth, and the faint silhouettes of Hanneman and Manuela near healing sigil ground. Byleth is visible in the background noticing the mistake. Nonlethal academy exercise only.\nCamera: handheld-like forward drift following Felix toward the northeast opening\nAvoid: straight training corridor, chalk lane, red-haired Felix, lethal attack, blood, war armor, older faces, generic soldiers, text, watermark",
