      "keyFramePrompt": "关键帧：At the northeast approach, Dedue, very tall, broad-shouldered, white-haired and shield-wall strong, blocks a padded strike with a large training shield while Dimitri, youthful blond prince, holds back behind him with restrained lance posture. Red-black Black Eagles pressure and distant faculty heal-tile silhouettes create depth beyond the low stone wall. The moment shows Blue Lions defensive discipline under Byleth teaching, not a random duel.\nCamera: medium-wide shield-line angle with Dimitri behind Dedue and northeast depth beyond\nAvoid: skinny Dedue, old Dimitri, straight training lane, lethal injury, blood, generic armor, wrong hair colors, text, watermark",
