      "keyFrameIntent": "旧版训练场/旧剧本关键帧，不能作为当前 Canon Map 模拟战视频资产：关键帧：模拟战动作完成或战术关系最清楚的一瞬，Dimitri 几乎过度攻击，看到 Byleth 手势后收剑",
      "keyFramePrompt": "关键帧：模拟战动作完成或战术关系最清楚的一瞬，Dimitri 几乎过度攻击，看到 Byleth 手势后收剑\nScene: 训练场. Characters: use selected assets and preserve identity. Camera: 慢动作一瞬. Generate a cinematic live-action storyboard key frame distinct from the start frame, showing the peak action or emotional beat. Keep academy students youthful and identity-locked. Avoid UI, text, watermark, modern objects, face swaps, old faces, and wrong costumes.",
      "sourcePackage": "episodes/EP02/video_generation_prompts_p1_act01_2026-07-13.md",
      "outputPath": "episodes/EP02/video_outputs/cinematic_v2/Shot033.mp4",
      "payloadProductionStatus": "needs_scene09_raster_review",
      "payloadProductionImagePath": "episodes/EP02/generated/mock_battle_production_keyframes_2026-07-17/Shot033_start.png",
      "payloadBlockedSourceImagePath": "",
      "payloadProductionPromptFile": "episodes/EP02/generated/mock_battle_production_keyframes_2026-07-17/prompts/Shot033_prompt.md",
      "cinematicBlock": "Mock Battle",
