      "keyFramePrompt": "关键帧：模拟战动作完成或战术关系最清楚的一瞬，对手退后，Blue Lions 稳住阵线\nScene: 训练场. Characters: use selected assets and preserve identity. Camera: 宽镜头. Generate a cinematic live-action storyboard key frame distinct from the start frame, showing the peak action or emotional beat. Keep academy students youthful and identity-locked. Avoid UI, text, watermark, modern objects, face swaps, old faces, and wrong costumes.",
